# Workflow
- Branch from current `develop`; one branch and one PR per issue; PR base `develop`.
- Exactly one commit ahead of `develop`, author `Joonkyo Kim <rootwarp@gmail.com>`. Review fixes amend + force-push the same branch.
- Before the PR: `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings`, `cargo nextest run --workspace --all-features` (`cargo test` still runs the suite); include the self-check from `AGENTS.md`.
- Do not self-review or run a review pass. Reviewers are Harper (Codex) and the Rust Security Auditor only. Do not merge.
